Vendored subset of the Superpowers skills library.

Upstream: https://github.com/obra/superpowers
Release: v7.0.1
Commit: 2ce8aa15d05bd57213e6f746f953aafb7ded7a8b

This directory holds the skill documents and the non-executable files they
reference. Hooks, plugin runtimes, and executable helpers are not included.
The upstream files left out are:

- skills/brainstorming/scripts/helper.js
- skills/brainstorming/scripts/server.cjs
- skills/brainstorming/scripts/start-server.sh
- skills/brainstorming/scripts/stop-server.sh
- skills/executing-plans/scripts/task-done
- skills/executing-plans/scripts/task-start
- skills/subagent-driven-development/scripts/review-package
- skills/subagent-driven-development/scripts/sdd-workspace
- skills/subagent-driven-development/scripts/task-brief
- skills/systematic-debugging/find-polluter.sh
- skills/writing-skills/render-graphs.js

Where a skill names one of those files, it is not in this checkout. Do not
recreate it. Follow the rest of the skill.

